Description: Wallpapers of the Total.js Developer Distros
 Twelve wallpapers at 3840 x 2160 with the logo of Total.js: six in graphite and
 the green of the logo, three with colors that remind of Ubuntu and three of Arch.
 They are installed in /usr/share/backgrounds/totaljs.
